# Copy this to .env (gitignored, never commit real values) and fill in a
# Spotify Developer app's credentials: https://developer.spotify.com/dashboard
# -> Create app (redirect URI doesn't matter, only Client Credentials flow is
# used, for catalog search — no user login/consent needed).
#
# These get baked into the built JS bundle at `docker compose build` time
# (see Dockerfile ARG/ENV + docker-compose.yml build.args), the same way the
# rest of this app has no backend — so this file needs to exist wherever the
# image is actually built (this machine for local dev, the deploy server for
# the real build), not just wherever you're editing code.
VITE_SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=
VITE_SPOTIFY_CLIENT_SECRET=
